# RULE 30 — CLAUDE-GREEN EVIDENCE FORMAT (owner 2026-08-02)

**Why:** Cursor PRs kept failing Rule 16 / DoD while Claude's went green. Not bad luck. Cursor wrote
`## Summary` fluff, put evidence only in the PR body, used weak `LIVE PROOF: UNVERIFIED browser`,
**stacked** on other open branches (inherited `fix(...)` commits with no `scripts/verify-*.mjs`),
and `git reset --soft origin/main` after main advanced (silently **deleted** other PRs' guards).

Claude's green shape is the law. Copy it. Do not invent a shorter Cursor variant.

## Canonical body + commit (identical labelled block)

Start at column 0 with `FINDING:` — **no** `## Summary` preamble. Same block in the **commit message**
and the **PR body** (squash will carry the commit):

```
FINDING: <id>
LANE: NON-FINANCIAL | FINANCIAL-HOLD | HOLD

ROOT CAUSE: <mechanism — not the symptom>

FIX: <root fix + files/guards>

DOD-A: PASS|N/A
DOD-B: PASS|N/A
DOD-C: PASS|N/A
DOD-D: PASS|N/A
DOD-E: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-1: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-2: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-3: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-4: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-5: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-6: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-7: PASS|N/A
VERIFY-8: PASS|N/A
MODULE_PROGRESS: <module> N of M
ITEMS_TOUCHED: <id>
MIGRATE: N/A | <filename>

GUARD: scripts/verify-<name>.mjs + scripts/verify-steps/NNNN-verify-<name>.mjs
LIVE PROOF: node scripts/verify-<name>.mjs --selftest exit 0; live run exit 0; verify-definition-of-done-evidence OK.
REMAINING: <what is still open — never claim module done>
```

`LIVE PROOF` must name a **command exit / sha / endpoint / count**. Gaps go in `REMAINING`, not as a
bare `LIVE PROOF: UNVERIFIED browser`. If truly unverified: `LIVE PROOF: UNVERIFIED: <named blocker>`.

Template: `docs/templates/CLAUDE-GREEN-PR-BODY.md`

## Ship procedure (HARD) — do this BEFORE every push / PR create

```bash
# 1. Write FINDING-first body (copy template — never ## Summary first)
cp docs/templates/CLAUDE-GREEN-PR-BODY.md /tmp/pr-body.txt
# edit /tmp/pr-body.txt

# 2. One local gate — must PASS (includes tip Claude-green + PR body)
node scripts/ops/cursor-ship-preflight.mjs --body-file /tmp/pr-body.txt

# 3. One push. Then: gh pr create --body-file /tmp/pr-body.txt
#    (or gh pr edit N --body-file /tmp/pr-body.txt). NEVER soft-reset.
```

**Mechanical:** tip commit AND PR body must start with `FINDING:` (column 0). `verify-claude-green-evidence-shape` FAILS otherwise. Empty `chore:` refreshes and `## Summary`-first bodies are forbidden forever.

## Ship procedure (HARD) — legacy checklist

1. **One commit** on top of **current** `origin/main` (cherry-pick onto main — never stack on another open PR).
2. `node scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` → must PASS (includes DoD + no-guard-deletion + evidence shape).
3. `node scripts/cursor-pr-body-gate.mjs --body-file /tmp/pr-body.txt` → must PASS before `gh pr create` / `gh pr edit`.
4. **One push.** Wait for CI. Never soft-reset onto a newer main to "refresh" evidence.

## Forbidden (these are the recurring reds)

| Forbidden | Why it fails |
|-----------|----------------|
| Stack PR on another open branch | `origin/main..HEAD` includes their `fix` commits without guards → DoD 1324 red |
| `git reset --soft origin/main` after main moved | Stages **deletes** of other merges' verify-steps → catastrophic |
| Empty `chore:` "refresh PR body" commits | Noise; use `gh pr edit` + labelled body |
| Evidence only in PR body, not commit | Squash/CI DoD reads **commits** |
| `LIVE PROOF: UNVERIFIED browser` (no `:` / `—` blocker) | CI proof substantiation rejects / is theater |
| `## Summary` replacing the labelled block | Agents omit `ROOT CAUSE:` as its own labelled line |

## Mechanical teeth

- `scripts/verify-no-guard-file-deletion.mjs` — branch must not delete `scripts/verify-*.mjs` / `verify-steps/` present on `origin/main` (unless `INTENTIONAL_GUARD_RETIRE:` in tip commit).
- `scripts/verify-claude-green-evidence-shape.mjs` — tip commit LIVE PROOF shape.
- `scripts/cursor-pr-body-gate.mjs` — local PR-body gate (same assertions as CI `check-pr-evidence-body`).
- Wired into `scripts/money-pr-local-gate.mjs` (Rule 29 suite). CI verify-step **2088**.

